sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Admin
  participant D as DietKnowledge
  participant G as Gemini
  participant V as VectorDb
  A->>D: Upload PDF/TXT (max 25 MB)
  D->>D: Extract text, split into chunks
  A->>D: Generate candidates (batch)
  D->>G: Summarize chunk (or placeholder)
  D->>D: Save KnowledgeCandidate = NeedsReview
  A->>D: Approve / reject candidate
  D->>D: Approve creates Approved guideline / food / recipe
  D->>V: Index approved content (embeddings)
